sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Web UI)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant SVC as Support Microservice
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AUTH as User Management Service

    C->>API: GET /support/faq?category=general
    API->>SVC: Forward Request (Authenticated)
    SVC->>DB: Query FAQ by category
    DB-->>SVC: Return FAQ List
    SVC-->>API: Return FAQ JSON
    API-->>C: Render FAQ List

    Note over C,DB: Admin Use Case (CRUD)
    C->>API: POST /support/faq (New FAQ)
    API->>AUTH: Verify Role (Admin)
    AUTH-->>API: OK
    API->>SVC: Create FAQ
    SVC->>DB: Insert New FAQ Entry
    DB-->>SVC: Success
    SVC-->>API: Response 201 Created
    API-->>C: Display “FAQ Added Successfully”